{
    "title": "Monster Job Search",
    "description": "Need to find jobs? Ours is the best job search app around \u2013 making it super simple to land your perfect match and fall in love with your career.\r\n\r\nOh, hello there. You must be looking for a job. Well, you came to the right app. Monster\u2019s job app is free and easy to use. We put millions (actual millions) of jobs right in the palm of your hand. When you see an opportunity you like, simply swipe right to apply. \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s so easy that over 15,000 Americans find jobs and apply on the Monster app every single week. That means that each month, we connect around 70,000 job seekers with employers looking to fill exciting opportunities. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re searching for your first job, a side hustle, new challenge, or a place at the top of the ladder, we\u2019ve got jobs for you. Monster is the original job search website, so we\u2019ve spent lots of time \u2013 a quarter of a century in fact - hanging around the proverbial water cooler listening to what hard working people really want. Then we created our job app with that in mind. \r\n\r\nCheck out some of our favorite features (we think they\u2019ll be your favorites too!):\r\n\r\nFind the Right Fit Fast: \r\n\u2022\tFilter part-time and work from home jobs to find the perfect fit for your lifestyle. \r\n\u2022\tFind jobs by searching for a job title and specific industry, or simply choose from what\u2019s popular right now.\r\n\r\nEasy Apply Options:\r\n\u2022\tSee something you like? Just swipe right to apply in seconds. Save time by applying to multiple jobs in a flash.\r\n\u2022\tStart fresh or upload an existing resume and kick off a new career today. Monster members enjoy a free digital resume review, helping you send tailored, top-notch applications at the tap of a finger. \r\n\r\nTailored for You: \r\n\u2022\tOur app is tailored just for you. You\u2019ll get personalized job recommendations, so you only see jobs you\u2019re actually qualified for and interested in. No more time wasters!\r\n\u2022\tSave specific job searches so you can easily return to them when the time is right, explore a range of industries, and browse in seconds. \r\n\r\nKnowledge in the Palm of Your Hand: \r\n\u2022\tNot sure which path you want to go down, or if your skills are being valued at market rate? Show off your skills, take a career quiz, compare salary estimates, and more all in one place.\r\n\u2022\tDiscover thousands of career advice articles on the go to help you master anything from writing the perfect cover letter to how to ask for a raise. \r\n\r\nWe don\u2019t want you to land just any job. We want you to be excited to wake up on a Monday and feel energized enough to sail through hump day, landing on Friday with a sense of accomplishment. If weekends or shift work are your gig, we\u2019ve got you covered there too. You see, we don\u2019t just help candidates find jobs, we help everyone find the right fit \u2013 whatever your lifestyle, preferences, and needs. \r\n\r\nYou can trust our word on this because Monster is\u202fa global leader in connecting job seekers like you with career opportunities where you feel happy, productive, and secure! We have 25 years under our belt of transforming the recruiting industry. This means that you have the best chance of finding exactly what you\u2019re looking for when you search for jobs right here on Monster. \r\n\r\nAnd since you can carry our handy app around in your pocket wherever you go, you can browse, save, and apply to better jobs on your morning commute, after that annoying meeting, or alongside your 3pm coffee. Plus, you never have to worry about missing a new opportunity thanks to our custom alerts, and you can check in on the status of multiple applications whenever it suits. \r\n\r\nWe know that not all jobs are created equally, you\u2019re looking for something as unique as your personal skillset, right? All good - we\u2019ve got jobs from every industry you can think of, at every level, and in every type of work environment. There really is something for everyone and we\u2019ll help you find that perfect fit faster than you can say \u201cI quit\u201d. Simply install our free job app, create a profile, and upload your resume today to start applying!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Need to find jobs? Ours is the best job search app around \u2013 making it super simple to land your perfect match and fall in love with your career.<br><br>Oh, hello there. You must be looking for a job. Well, you came to the right app. Monster\u2019s job app is free and easy to use. We put millions (actual millions) of jobs right in the palm of your hand. When you see an opportunity you like, simply swipe right to apply. <br><br>It\u2019s so easy that over 15,000 Americans find jobs and apply on the Monster app every single week. That means that each month, we connect around 70,000 job seekers with employers looking to fill exciting opportunities. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re searching for your first job, a side hustle, new challenge, or a place at the top of the ladder, we\u2019ve got jobs for you. Monster is the original job search website, so we\u2019ve spent lots of time \u2013 a quarter of a century in fact - hanging around the proverbial water cooler listening to what hard working people really want. Then we created our job app with that in mind. <br><br>Check out some of our favorite features (we think they\u2019ll be your favorites too!):<br><br>Find the Right Fit Fast: <br>\u2022\tFilter part-time and work from home jobs to find the perfect fit for your lifestyle. <br>\u2022\tFind jobs by searching for a job title and specific industry, or simply choose from what\u2019s popular right now.<br><br>Easy Apply Options:<br>\u2022\tSee something you like? Just swipe right to apply in seconds. Save time by applying to multiple jobs in a flash.<br>\u2022\tStart fresh or upload an existing resume and kick off a new career today. Monster members enjoy a free digital resume review, helping you send tailored, top-notch applications at the tap of a finger. <br><br>Tailored for You: <br>\u2022\tOur app is tailored just for you. You\u2019ll get personalized job recommendations, so you only see jobs you\u2019re actually qualified for and interested